   "text": "@WhipKClark This is nonsense. You are responsible for the high prices you old skunk! \n\nGet rid of site of service arbitrage, stop taking money from the hospital association, get rid of CON laws, stop pretending less supply = lower prices. \n\nDo they teach arithmetic in Massachusetts?",
